# Git LFS tracking for binary brief artifacts and other large files.
# Applies to NEW files only — does not retroactively migrate existing files.
*.pdf  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.docx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pptx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Per-path LFS exceptions. These nine files were
# committed as raw binary BEFORE LFS smudge/clean filters were wired
# in the committer's local clone, so the blobs in HEAD are the full
# binary content rather than ~130-byte LFS pointers. The wildcard
# rules above caused LFS to emit "Encountered N files that should have
# been pointers, but weren't" on every fresh worktree create, plus
# spurious "modified" status in `git status` and friction on routine
# `git worktree remove` (always needs --force because the working-tree
# bytes don't match what LFS expects).
#
# Rather than rewriting history (`git lfs migrate import` — coordination
# cost across every open PR that touches these paths), we exempt these
# specific paths from LFS tracking. They've been modified zero times
# since initial commit and aren't expected to be re-edited; storing
# them as raw binary in git is the right disposition. New files added
# under the wildcard patterns above continue to be LFS-tracked.
#
# `binary` is a macro for `-text -diff`. `-filter -merge` strips the
# LFS filter + merge driver explicitly. Result: git treats these as
# normal binary blobs, no LFS round-trip.
docs/design/concept-of-employment.pdf                                   -filter -merge binary
docs/design/ha-failover.pdf                                             -filter -merge binary
docs/design/tech-strategy.pdf                                           -filter -merge binary
"docs/reference/externally-created/Conceptual Visual Layout v2.pptx"    -filter -merge binary
docs/reference/externally-created/goat-net-briefing-illustrated.pdf     -filter -merge binary
"docs/reference/memos/ADOC Update Brief_10MAR26_DAS.pptx"               -filter -merge binary
docs/reference/memos/ARN44562-PPM_CIO-085-000-WEB-1.pdf                 -filter -merge binary
docs/reference/pleo-tactical-requirements.pdf                           -filter -merge binary
docs/reference/vendors/Cape_Overview.pdf                                -filter -merge binary
